<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel"> 
      <p xml:id="Aink174-kilavi">
        kuṟivaḻicceṉṟu talaimakaḷaik kaṇṭuvantapāṅkaṉ avaḷ niṉṟuḻi niṉṟāḷeṉṟu kūṟiyavaḻi āṇṭuc cellakkarutiya talaimakaṉ taṉṉuḷḷē colliyatu.</p>    <p xml:lang="en">
          Spoken by the hero to his own heart which intended to go over there to the path that was spoken of by the male friend, who returned, having [just] gone to [that] path of the tryst [and] having seen the heroine, saying 'she was standing [and] waiting there'.</p>
  </div> 
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="Aink174">
<l>aṇaṅk* uṭaip paṉittuṟait toṇṭi yaṉṉa</l>
<l>maṇaṅkamaḻ poḻiṟkuṟi nalkiṉa ṇuṇaṅkiḻaip</l>
<l>poṅkari paranta vuṇka</l>
<l>ṇaṅkaliḻ mēṉi yacaiiya vemakkē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
       <l> [The lady with] a pretty, shining body [and] kajal-rimmed eyes in which rising, red streaks spread</l>
       <l> Like the dewy ghat of Toṇṭi which possesses torment,</l>
       <l> Granted me who was wearied,</l>
       <l> A tryst in a grove in which fragrances were fragrant.  </l>    </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
